14 TL
(P5.WAVES GUIDE \(v2.0.0\) A gentle, practical guide from basics to full play mode.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj
T*
(p5.waves is a tiny math helper. You give it a single input \(y\) and it gives you a stable) Tj
T*
(offset \(x, z, or both\). It does not draw. It does not animate. It simply returns numbers you) Tj
T*
(can use anywhere in your sketch.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHAT IT'S GOOD FOR) Tj
T*
(- Wavy lines and ribbons - Grids and flow fields - Subtle motion \(breathing, bobbing,) Tj
T*
(swaying\) - Reproducible offsets for layout and generative art - 3D motion in WEBGL - Mapping) Tj
T*
(numbers to color, size, rotation, and alpha) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHAT IT DOES NOT DO) Tj
T*
(- It does not manage time. You control time by changing the input. - It does not edit or add) Tj
T*
(new formulas at runtime. - It does not draw shapes or manage sprites.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(MENTAL MODEL) Tj
T*
(Think of a wave preset as a tiny formula: algo\(x\) -> number. You pass y, the library treats) Tj
T*
(it as x, and returns a number. You decide how to use it: shift a point, rotate a shape,) Tj
T*
(drive color, or build a flow field.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(QUICK START \(GLOBAL MODE\)) Tj
T*
(------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(HTML:) Tj
T*
(  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/p5@2.1.1/lib/p5.js"></script>) Tj
T*
(  <script src="p5.waves.min.js"></script>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sketch:) Tj
T*
(  function setup\(\) {) Tj
T*
(    createCanvas\(400, 200\);) Tj
T*
(    noFill\(\);) Tj
T*
(    stroke\(20\);) Tj
T*
(  }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  function draw\(\) {) Tj
T*
(    background\(240\);) Tj
T*
(    beginShape\(\);) Tj
T*
(    for \(let y = 0; y <= height; y += 4\) {) Tj
T*
(      const x = Waves.wave\(y + frameCount * 0.02, 'classicSine', null, { amplitude: 80 }\);) Tj
T*
(      vertex\(width / 2 + x, y\);) Tj
T*
(    }) Tj
T*
(    endShape\(\);) Tj
T*
(  }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(BASICS) Tj
T*
(------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
